# AICL Example: Merge Sorted Arrays
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Merge two sorted arrays

Layer:
Core

Behavior Merge
    Input: a, b
    Output: result
    Action:
        result = []
        i = 0
        j = 0
        while i < len(a) and j < len(b):
            if a[i] <= b[j]:
                result.append(a[i])
                i = i + 1
            else:
                result.append(b[j])
                j = j + 1
        while i < len(a):
            result.append(a[i])
            i = i + 1
        while j < len(b):
            result.append(b[j])
            j = j + 1
        return result
